    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper view over <ref refid="structthemis_1_1license_1_1_license_data" kindref="compound">LicenseData</ref> providing computed runtime properties. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wraps a <ref refid="structthemis_1_1license_1_1_license_data" kindref="compound">LicenseData</ref> reference to expose properties that are computed from the raw data, such as the remaining grace period after expiry.</para>
<para>Example: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>lic<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1license_1ab8fe53fe64a9f428f396975e824be913" kindref="member">getEmbeddedLicense</ref>();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(lic)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1license_1_1_license_info_1a58e5a929f56a8d735222cee7f40ee478" kindref="member">LicenseInfo</ref><sp/>info(*lic);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">int</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>days<sp/>=<sp/>info.remaining_grace_days();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
